o patience. Kyrstyn has her younger sister aged 11 or 12 watch the baby a lot, get the bottle, feed, etc. This child feels responsible for the infant more than Kyrstyn does.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Kyrstyn has not seen the ob gyn since giving birth.</p><p><br></p><p>Kyrstyn is now dating a man she met on the internet. Grandma won't let her take the baby around him so grandma has the baby even more and grandma works. Kyrstyn will get mad and threatens to keep the baby away from grandma.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Reporter states the baby is not neglected and is safe with grandma.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>This worker explained in home service referral since no CPS issues. She states the doctors office staff , mom and grandma are having a meeting today and they will discuss. Advised to call back with an answer or if Mom would like to hear more information.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>3:10 pm&nbsp;</p><p>Grandma Rebecca called back and said Doctor office gave them my number. Kyrstyn was scared to get on phone. Once able to talk to her explained in home services. She states she is interested. Not sure completelof&nbsp;what she needs but referrals for housing, ways to be more independent and she assumes she will be getting more information today about post-partum&nbsp;depression and potentially referrals for that. Rebecca confirmed that DSS personnel okay to be at her house.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>", "CreatedDate": "2021-06-23T19:44:11.976Z", "InputSource": "0bdda2ab-b74f-4d74-ba17-3b9b37a9ca19", "PurposeName": "Request for services", "RecivedDate": "6/23/2021, 1:36:00 PM", "teamtypekey": "CW", "IntakeNumber": "I211010168946", "LegalGuardian": "KYRSTYN MARTIN", "intakeservice": [{"description": "In Home Services", "intakeservid": "34ed3645-252d-4b1f-8b40-c3387087fed4", "intakesubservice": [{"activeflag": 1, "intakeservid": "34ed3645-252d-4b1f-8b40-c3387087fed4", "typedescription": "Services to Family and Children", "intakeservsubtypeid": "03b7c2e7-09b1-4d0b-9d29-a12f53379fe2", "intakese